{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>C4 Clicker: First Mint</strong>, a clicker game where fake coins are serious business (not really).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t your average idle game. It\u2019s a crypto parody packed with ridiculous token farming, market chaos, and just enough trading knowledge to confuse your inner bag-holder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>FEATURES:</strong><br>\u2022 Click to mint worthless coins faster than a scam DAO<br>\u2022 Unlock <strong>Steam Inventory Items</strong> as in-game drops<br>\u2022 Earn all <strong>Steam Achievements</strong> in one wild ride<br>\u2022 Use the <strong>in-game console</strong> to explore real-world trading concepts<br>\u2192 Indicators, charting, trend analysis, FOMO, mini games \u2014 all gamified <br>\u2022 Parody crypto culture, rug pulls, and late-night trading YouTubers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae No blockchain. No NFTs. Just satire, Steam items, and fake financial clout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't get rich. But you <i>will</i> click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Drops occur every 60 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Rarity Distribution</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal</strong> \u2014 60.8%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Common</strong> \u2014 21.7%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncommon-ish</strong> \u2014 13.0%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncommon</strong> \u2014 4.2%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare</strong> \u2014 0.17%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Very Rare</strong> \u2014 0.087%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each drop produces a real Steam inventory item that can be traded or sold on the Community Market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No real-world cryptocurrency.<br>Just parody tokens, market chaos, and the thrill of the mint.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"XRPlease Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857120/056bcec6f247f1209af36365bf449d738c8a86f9.jpg"},{"name":"XRPlease Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857120/e67235f1a82c87142780a895af61f233ad478437.jpg"},{"name":"XRPlease Whale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857120/0da1ce27564696aca59a4f176a95995859d1538b.jpg"},{"name":"First Mint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857120/4882c100f453b3943f85684067a0529dac4e450b.jpg"},{"name":"Proof of Tap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857120/f175850d091e424f88b6b5d53bd587aab50ad5ea.jpg"},{"name":"Gas Guzzler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857120/0e83b1d6540e9e971bc17e1192b0268960faf3ca.jpg"},{"name":"Whale in Training","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857120/1abbc6d4520fc20c58fa1cb6b8c084f06147037c.jpg"},{"name":"DeFi Degenerate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857120/0b21889f6987a41248bb3fb0a347e6ff3246a976.jpg"},{"name":"Market Maker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857120/5eadf4d4dd110509fec68a6b70318a0bb6e28fff.jpg"},{"name":"Legend of the Ledger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857120/a047f4a952abff4445c658c2672a910751c7c4a0.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857120?t=1767896903","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857120/491cbecfb5089ed09f46bf89aac2552cb5ce5e5e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767896903","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/385