graph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Drops occur every 60 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Rarity Distribution</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal</strong> \u2014 60.8%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Common</strong> \u2014 21.7%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncommon-ish</strong> \u2014 13.0%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncommon</strong> \u2014 4.2%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare</strong> \u2014 0.17%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Very Rare</strong> \u2014 0.087%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each drop produces a real Steam inventory item that can be traded or sold on the Community Market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No real-world cryptocurrency.<br>Just parody tokens, market chaos, and the thrill of the mint.</p>","developers":["Capital Caps"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857120/24db017f53ae37f9f5256175596efdffabf20418/header.jpg?t=1767896903","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Capital Caps. All rights reserved. C4 Clicker and all associated assets are the intellectual property of Capital Caps. This product is a work of satire and is not affiliated with any real-world cryptocurrency or financial entity.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 / SteamOS 3<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.0 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><s